        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Select multiple archives (.zip, .tar, .tar.gz) at once to batch import, or pick a single folder. Each package must contain a typst.toml manifest.\n\nYou can also place unarchived package folders directly into the LocalPackages directory via the Files app — they will be picked up automatically."
